{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were an upcoming phonk producer going to play your best song at the concert... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...but then something went terribly wrong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot zombies, ghosts, demons n shit, while blasting cowbell tunes non-stop in this retro boomer shooter inspired by 90s cult classics, glitchy VHS visuals and phonk aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/ba5ebe933990fae103735f4dcbcdbdd0.poster.avif?t=1756364559\" width=690 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/ba5ebe933990fae103735f4dcbcdbdd0.webm?t=1756364559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/ba5ebe933990fae103735f4dcbcdbdd0.mp4?t=1756364559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot enemies with weapons:</strong><br>+ 5* different weapons to choose from<br>+ 5* enemy types with unique attacks and behavior<br>+ Ammo, reloading, powerups, classic stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* - more are being added</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and press [E] on some objects:</strong><br>+ Interact with various objects: open doors, pull levers, use laptops, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ Find hidden areas and uncover secrets scattered throughout the maps.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impress some hot baddies with your high-score:</strong><br>+ There is a light dialog system, so you can talk to some characters. (dialog is optional)<br>+ Basic score/rank system upon clearing the level. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/b8a7838605e0e6d74dd246e134a1a13c.poster.avif?t=1756364559\" width=690 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/b8a7838605e0e6d74dd246e134a1a13c.webm?t=1756364559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/b8a7838605e0e6d74dd246e134a1a13c.mp4?t=1756364559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phonk soundtrack to pump you up:<br>+ </strong>Various phonk styles: cowbell/drift/house/memphis/cloud phonk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS shaders so your graphics card is working hard to make the game look worse :D</strong> <br>+ Noise, chromatic abberation, visual distortion, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made by solo developer with custom game engine:<br>+ </strong>Your feedback can help improve the game<br>+ No budget cuts <strong><br>+ </strong>Bugs handcrafted with love &lt;3</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/25c1467c465a58a2a9c051a9d93ccb85.poster.avif?t=1756364559\" width=690 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/25c1467c465a58a2a9c051a9d93ccb85.webm?t=1756364559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/25c1467c465a58a2a9c051a9d93ccb85.mp4?t=1756364559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No lootboxes, battle-passes and other nonsense like triple A.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/4361225348619dc24268e9fc6729129a.poster.avif?t=1756364559\" width=256 height=227 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/4361225348619dc24268e9fc6729129a.webm?t=1756364559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599860?t=1756364559","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599860?t=1756364559","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/3f5a6ebff4fce1b60725fb10feb1042e89cadb60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756364559","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/3f5a6ebff4fce1b60725fb10feb1042e89cadb60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756364559","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is pixelated blood and gore, depictions of skeletons and demons. There are suggestive character outfits, but no nudity."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were an upcoming phonk producer going to play your best song at the concert... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...but then something went terribly wrong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot zombies, ghosts, demons n shit, while blasting cowbell tunes non-stop i